{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017E38kHE3ojscBNrH543oJ4","type":"tool_result","content":"# 03: Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel\n\n**What to build:** On the seat map the customer selects and deselects seats and couches, up to 10 seats per booking with a couch counting as 2. Unavailable seats cannot be selected. Exceeding the limit shows a toast. Every state has its colour, the legend explains them, and the selected-seats panel lists the current selection by row.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.2, 5.2, 5.3, 5.5, 9.2, 9.6, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 02 — Auditorium map.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-16 — Seats listed in `occupiedSeats` for the screening are rendered unavailable and cannot be selected.\n- [ ] AC-17 — A couch is unavailable when either of its two seat identifiers is in `occupiedSeats`.\n- [ ] AC-18 — Clicking an available seat selects it; clicking it again deselects it.\n- [ ] AC-19 — Clicking a couch selects both of its seats as one unit; it cannot be half-selected.\n- [ ] AC-20 — Selection is capped at 10 seats; a couch counts as 2.\n- [ ] AC-21 — A click that would exceed 10 seats is ignored and shows the toast `Maximum 10 seats per booking`.\n- [ ] AC-22 — At the cap, already selected seats and couches can still be deselected.\n- [ ] AC-23 — The legend lists exactly `Available`, `Selected`, `Unavailable`, `Accessible`.\n- [ ] AC-24 — Available seats use `#2E7D32`.\n- [ ] AC-25 — Selected seats use `#F9A825`.\n- [ ] AC-26 — Unavailable seats use `#C62828`.\n- [ ] AC-27 — Accessible seats use `#1565C0`.\n- [ ] AC-58 — Between the seat map and the `Cancel` / `Continue` buttons, the selected-seats panel shows `Selected seats: <n>` and one `Row <r>: <seats>` line per row, updated on every selection change.\n- [ ] AC-66 — Every seat-selection identifier in section 9.2, and the toast identifier in section 9.6, is present with the exact names and values given there.\n M apps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\n M apps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\n M spec/tickets/01-movie-list.md\n?? .pnpm-store/\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/cinema-api.service.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/dates.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/models.ts\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/\n?? apps/cinescope/src/app/screen-placeholder.ts\n17128d5 feat: scaffold app\neslint.config.mjs\nproject.json\npublic\nsrc\ntsconfig.app.json\ntsconfig.json\ntsconfig.spec.json\n{\n  \"name\": \"cinescope\",\n  \"$schema\": \"../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json\",\n  \"projectType\": \"application\",\n  \"prefix\": \"app\",\n  \"sourceRoot\": \"apps/cinescope/src\",\n  \"tags\": [],\n  \"targets\": {\n    \"build\": {\n      \"executor\": \"@angular/build:application\",\n      \"outputs\": [\n        \"{options.outputPath}\"\n      ],\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"production\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"outputPath\": \"dist/apps/cinescope\",\n        \"browser\": \"apps/cinescope/src/main.ts\",\n        \"tsConfig\": \"apps/cinescope/tsconfig.app.json\",\n        \"inlineStyleLanguage\": \"scss\",\n        \"assets\": [\n          {\n            \"glob\": \"**/*\",\n            \"input\": \"apps/cinescope/public\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"styles\": [\n          \"apps/cinescope/src/styles.scss\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"production\": {\n          \"budgets\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"initial\",\n              \"maximumWarning\": \"500kb\",\n              \"maximumError\": \"1mb\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"outputHashing\": \"all\"\n        },\n        \"development\": {\n          \"optimization\": false,\n          \"extractLicenses\": false,\n          \"sourceMap\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"serve\": {\n      \"continuous\": true,\n      \"executor\": \"@angular/build:dev-server\",\n      \"defaultConfiguration\": \"development\",\n      \"options\": {\n        \"port\": 4200\n      },\n      \"configurations\": {\n        \"production\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"cinescope:build:production\"\n        },\n        \"development\": {\n          \"buildTarget\": \"cinescope:build:development\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hu55tLDtijPtsAPNBAaVA8","session_id":"da796ddb-14b5-4081-b15a-294e50582b81","uuid":"3909912c-7b44-4617-ad55-8ea58fb07c3d","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:25:48.428Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 02"}
