{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HuhkE2FtALtGoJxL9fE9WK","type":"tool_result","content":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\n# Tickets\n\nWork through the tickets in order. A ticket can start once every ticket in its\n**Blocked by** line is done. The specification is [`../README.md`](../README.md); each\nticket names the sections it implements and the acceptance criteria it must satisfy.\n\n| # | Ticket | Blocked by | Criteria |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 01 | [Movie list and day picker](01-movie-list.md) | — | 11 |\n| 02 | [Auditorium map](02-auditorium-map.md) | 01 | 13 |\n| 03 | [Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel](03-seat-selection.md) | 02 | 14 |\n| 04 | [Booking and summary](04-booking-summary.md) | 03 | 16 |\n| 05 | [Checkout and payment](05-checkout.md) | 04 | 13 |\n| 06 | [Confirmation and booking lifecycle](06-confirmation.md) | 05 | 2 |\n| 07 | [Final pass](07-final-pass.md) | 01–06 | all |\n\nA ticket is done when every box in it is ticked and `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n----\n# 05: Checkout and payment\n\n**What to build:** The customer fills in their details on the checkout form (`Your details`), sees validation messages as they go, can go `Back` to the summary and return — or reload — without losing what they typed, and pays with the `Pay <total> PLN` button. Paying sends the reservation to the backend; success opens `/confirmation`, failure keeps the form and shows a toast.\n\n**Specification:** sections 2.1, 2.2 (`POST /reservations`), 3.1, 7, 9.4, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 04 — Booking and summary.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-41 — The form renders first name, last name, email, confirm email, phone number and a terms checkbox.\n- [ ] AC-42 — First name and last name are required and must be at least 2 characters.\n- [ ] AC-43 — Email is required and must be a valid address; confirm email must match it.\n- [ ] AC-44 — Phone number is optional; when filled it must be exactly 9 digits.\n- [ ] AC-45 — The terms checkbox is required.\n- [ ] AC-46 — The pay button is enabled whenever no payment request is in flight; clicking it on an invalid form marks all fields as touched, shows the messages and shows the toast `The form contains errors`, without navigating.\n- [ ] AC-47 — The pay button on a valid form sends `POST /reservations`, is disabled while the request is in flight, navigates to `/confirmation` on success, and on failure stays on the form and shows the toast `Payment failed. Please try again.`\n- [ ] AC-61 — The checkout shows the title `Your details`.\n- [ ] AC-62 — The pay button reads `Pay <total> PLN`, the total of the booking.\n- [ ] AC-63 — `Back` on the checkout returns to the summary with the booking intact.\n- [ ] AC-64 — The checkout values survive going back to the summary and forward again, and a page reload; a new booking starts with an empty form.\n- [ ] AC-65 — The labels of the five required fields end with `*`; the phone label does not.\n- [ ] AC-68 — Every checkout identifier in section 9.4 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n----\napps/cinescope/src:\napp\nindex.html\nmain.ts\nstyles.scss\n\napps/cinescope/src/app:\napp.config.ts\napp.html\napp.routes.ts\napp.scss\napp.spec.ts\napp.ts\nbooking.spec.ts\nbooking.ts\ncinema-api.service.ts\ndates.ts\nmodels.ts\nmovie-list\npricing.ts\nscreen-placeholder.ts\nseat-selection\nsummary\ntoast.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list:\nmovie-list.html\nmovie-list.scss\nmovie-list.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection:\nauditorium.spec.ts\nauditorium.ts\nseat-selection.html\nseat-selection.scss\nseat-selection.ts\n\napps/cinescope/src/app/summary:\nsummary.html\nsummary.scss\nsummary.ts\n674 spec/README.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BBnqnkqvvt1mUsXYs1jhA3","session_id":"da796ddb-14b5-4081-b15a-294e50582b81","uuid":"c4d46c18-cf1c-41a2-9bab-44297cbde9f4","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:33:22.530Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 05"}
