{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTjPFaGDA8DKECAVnXva","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UC9yCgLfL9egu8Mc4kxQaH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat spec/tickets/06-confirmation.md && echo ---- && cat apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.ts && echo ---- && cat apps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.html | head -40 && echo ---- && git diff -- spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md | head -30 && ls node_modules/@angular/material | head -80 | tr '\\n' ' ' && cat apps/cinescope/src/styles.scss | head -30 && ls apps/cinescope && cat apps/cinescope/eslint.config.* 2>/dev/null | head -60","description":"Read ticket 06, movie list, and lint config"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11805,"cache_read_input_tokens":41510,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11805,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BBnqnkqvvt1mUsXYs1jhA3","session_id":"da796ddb-14b5-4081-b15a-294e50582b81","uuid":"648f18ee-53df-4d7a-bb51-bcc48ae72273","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:34:27.203Z","request_id":"req_011ChTjPFQbYLpeKCWXP4nd9","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 05"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UC9yCgLfL9egu8Mc4kxQaH","type":"tool_result","content":"# 06: Confirmation and booking lifecycle\n\n**What to build:** After a successful payment the customer sees the confirmation with their email address; `Continue` clears the booking and returns to `/`. The whole booking lifecycle from section 3.1 holds: it survives reloads, and every route guards against a missing or mismatched booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 8, 9.5.\n\n**Blocked by:** 05 — Checkout and payment.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] AC-48 — `/confirmation` shows `Payment successful` and `Your tickets will be sent shortly to <email>`; `Continue` navigates to `/` and clears the booking; the booking survives a reload via `sessionStorage`; entering the summary, checkout or confirmation without a matching booking redirects to `/`.\n- [ ] AC-69 — Every confirmation identifier in section 9.5 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [ ] Reloading `/confirmation` after paying still shows the confirmation.\n- [ ] After `Continue`, the seat map of the same screening shows no selected seats and the checkout form of a new booking is empty.\n----\nimport { Component, computed, inject, signal } from '@angular/core';\nimport { toObservable, toSignal } from '@angular/core/rxjs-interop';\nimport { MatButtonModule } from '@angular/material/button';\nimport { MatDatepickerModule, MatDatepickerInputEvent } from '@angular/material/datepicker';\nimport { MatFormFieldModule } from '@angular/material/form-field';\nimport { MatInputModule } from '@angular/material/input';\nimport { MatProgressSpinnerModule } from '@angular/material/progress-spinner';\nimport { ActivatedRoute, Router } from '@angular/router';\nimport { catchError, forkJoin, map, of, startWith, switchMap } from 'rxjs';\nimport { CinemaApi } from '../cinema-api.service';\nimport { WEEKDAY_NAMES, addDays, parseIsoDate, startOfToday, toIsoDate } from '../dates';\nimport { Movie, Screening } from '../models';\n\ninterface DayButton {\n  iso: string;\n  label: string;\n}\n\ninterface MovieWithScreenings {\n  movie: Movie;\n  screenings: Screening[];\n}\n\ntype MovieListState =\n  | { status: 'loading' }\n  | { status: 'error' }\n  | { status: 'loaded'; movies: MovieWithScreenings[] };\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-movie-list',\n  imports: [MatButtonModule, MatDatepickerModule, MatFormFieldModule, MatInputModule, MatProgressSpinnerModule],\n  templateUrl: './movie-list.html',\n  styleUrl: './movie-list.scss',\n})\nexport class MovieList {\n  private readonly api = inject(CinemaApi);\n  private readonly router = inject(Router);\n  private readonly route = inject(ActivatedRoute);\n\n  private readonly todayDate = startOfToday();\n  private readonly todayIso = toIsoDate(this.todayDate);\n\n  readonly todayPickerMin = this.todayDate;\n  readonly dayButtons: DayButton[] = Array.from({ length: 5 }, (_, offset) => {\n    const date = addDays(this.todayDate, offset);\n    return {\n      iso: toIsoDate(date),\n      label: offset === 0 ? 'Today' : WEEKDAY_NAMES[date.getDay()],\n    };\n  });\n\n  private readonly queryDate = toSignal(\n    this.route.queryParamMap.pipe(map((params) => params.get('date'))),\n    { initialValue: null },\n  );\n\n  /** `?date=` when it is a real date that is not in the past, otherwise today. */\n  readonly selectedDate = computed(() => {\n    const requested = this.queryDate();\n    const isUsable = parseIsoDate(requested) !== null && requested !== null && requested >= this.todayIso;\n    return isUsable ? requested : this.todayIso;\n  });\n\n  /** The datepicker shows the date only when it is not one of the five day buttons. */\n  readonly pickerValue = computed(() => {\n    const selected = this.selectedDate();\n    return this.dayButtons.some((day) => day.iso === selected) ? null : parseIsoDate(selected);\n  });\n\n  private readonly attempt = signal(0);\n\n  private readonly request = computed(() => ({ date: this.selectedDate(), attempt: this.attempt() }));\n\n  readonly state = toSignal<MovieListState, MovieListState>(\n    toObservable(this.request).pipe(\n      switchMap(({ date }) =>\n        forkJoin({ movies: this.api.movies(), screenings: this.api.screeningsOn(date) }).pipe(\n          map(({ movies, screenings }) => ({\n            status: 'loaded' as const,\n            movies: groupScreenings(movies, screenings),\n          })),\n          startWith<MovieListState>({ status: 'loading' }),\n          catchError(() => of<MovieListState>({ status: 'error' })),\n        ),\n      ),\n    ),\n    { initialValue: { status: 'loading' } },\n  );\n\n  isSelected(day: DayButton): boolean {\n    return day.iso === this.selectedDate();\n  }\n\n  chooseDate(iso: string | null): void {\n    this.router.navigate([], { relativeTo: this.route, queryParams: { date: iso } });\n  }\n\n  onDatePicked(event: MatDatepickerInputEvent<Date>): void {\n    this.chooseDate(event.value ? toIsoDate(event.value) : null);\n  }\n\n  retry(): void {\n    this.attempt.update((count) => count + 1);\n  }\n\n  openScreening(id: number): void {\n    this.router.navigate(['/screenings', id, 'seats']);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction groupScreenings(movies: Movie[], screenings: Screening[]): MovieWithScreenings[] {\n  const byMovie = new Map<number, Screening[]>();\n  for (const screening of screenings) {\n    byMovie.set(screening.movieId, [...(byMovie.get(screening.movieId) ?? []), screening]);\n  }\n  return movies.flatMap((movie) => {\n    const movieScreenings = (byMovie.get(movie.id) ?? []).sort((a, b) => a.time.localeCompare(b.time));\n    return movieScreenings.length > 0 ? [{ movie, screenings: movieScreenings }] : [];\n  });\n}\n----\n<main class=\"movie-list-page\">\n  <div class=\"day-picker\" data-testid=\"day-picker\">\n    @for (day of dayButtons; track day.iso) {\n      <button\n        type=\"button\"\n        data-testid=\"day-button\"\n        [matButton]=\"isSelected(day) ? 'filled' : 'outlined'\"\n        [attr.data-date]=\"day.iso\"\n        [attr.data-selected]=\"isSelected(day) ? 'true' : 'false'\"\n        (click)=\"chooseDate(day.iso)\"\n      >\n        {{ day.label }}\n      </button>\n    }\n\n    <mat-form-field class=\"date-field\">\n      <mat-label>Choose another date</mat-label>\n      <input\n        matInput\n        data-testid=\"date-picker\"\n        [matDatepicker]=\"picker\"\n        [min]=\"todayPickerMin\"\n        [value]=\"pickerValue()\"\n        (dateChange)=\"onDatePicked($event)\"\n      />\n      <mat-datepicker-toggle matIconSuffix [for]=\"picker\" />\n      <mat-datepicker #picker />\n    </mat-form-field>\n  </div>\n\n  @let current = state();\n  @if (current.status === 'loading') {\n    <div class=\"movies-state\" data-testid=\"movies-loading\">\n      <mat-spinner diameter=\"32\" />\n      <p>Loading…</p>\n    </div>\n  } @else if (current.status === 'error') {\n    <div class=\"movies-state\">\n      <p data-testid=\"movies-error\">Failed to load movies</p>\n      <button type=\"button\" matButton=\"filled\" data-testid=\"movies-retry-button\" (click)=\"retry()\">Retry</button>\n----\ndiff --git a/spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md b/spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md\nindex 5fa011a..ab12463 100644\n--- a/spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md\n+++ b/spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md\n@@ -8,20 +8,20 @@\n \n **Status:** ready\n \n-- [ ] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n-- [ ] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n-- [ ] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n-- [ ] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n-- [ ] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n-- [ ] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n-- [ ] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n-- [ ] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n-- [ ] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n-- [ ] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n-- [ ] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n-- [ ] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n-- [ ] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n-- [ ] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n-- [ ] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n-- [ ] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n-- [ ] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.\n+- [x] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n+- [x] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n+- [x] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n+- [x] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n+- [x] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\nLICENSE README.md _index.scss autocomplete badge bottom-sheet button button-toggle card checkbox chips core datepicker dialog divider expansion fesm2022 form-field grid-list icon input list menu package.json paginator prebuilt-themes progress-bar progress-spinner radio schematics select sidenav slide-toggle slider snack-bar sort stepper table tabs timepicker toolbar tooltip tree types @use '@angular/material' as mat;\n\nhtml {\n  color-scheme: light;\n  @include mat.theme(\n    (\n      color: mat.$azure-palette,\n      typography: Roboto,\n      density: 0,\n    )\n  );\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\n}\neslint.config.mjs\nproject.json\npublic\nsrc\ntsconfig.app.json\ntsconfig.json\ntsconfig.spec.json\nimport nx from '@nx/eslint-plugin';\nimport baseConfig from '../../eslint.config.mjs';\n\nexport default [\n  ...nx.configs['flat/angular'],\n  ...nx.configs['flat/angular-template'],\n  ...baseConfig,\n  {\n    files: ['**/*.ts'],\n    rules: {\n      '@angular-eslint/directive-selector': [\n        'error',\n        {\n          type: 'attribute',\n          prefix: 'app',\n          style: 'camelCase',\n        },\n      ],\n      '@angular-eslint/component-selector': [\n        'error',\n        {\n          type: 'element',\n          prefix: 'app',\n          style: 'kebab-case',\n        },\n      ],\n    },\n  },\n  {\n    files: ['**/*.html'],\n    // Override or add rules here\n    rules: {},\n  },\n];","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BBnqnkqvvt1mUsXYs1jhA3","session_id":"da796ddb-14b5-4081-b15a-294e50582b81","uuid":"db8c0c65-ece2-4efe-86fb-772e54d447b1","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:34:27.277Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 05"}
