{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AMhm8nRPgTDz7qY4Q2vcY5","type":"tool_result","content":"# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n----\n# 07: Final pass\n\n**What to build:** A walk through the whole flow — movie list, seat map, summary, checkout,\nconfirmation — against the specification, fixing whatever does not match.\n\n**Specification:** the whole of `README.md`, section 9 in particular.\n\n**Blocked by:** 01–06.\n\n**Status:** ready\n\n- [ ] Every acceptance criterion in section 10 is met.\n- [ ] `pnpm nx build cinescope` succeeds.\n----\n674 spec/README.md\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.config.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.routes.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/app.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/booking.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/booking.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/checkout/checkout-rules.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/checkout/checkout-rules.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/checkout/checkout.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/checkout/checkout.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/checkout/checkout.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/cinema-api.service.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/confirmation/confirmation.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/confirmation/confirmation.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/confirmation/confirmation.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/dates.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/models.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/movie-list/movie-list.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/pricing.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection/auditorium.spec.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection/auditorium.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection/seat-selection.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection/seat-selection.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/seat-selection/seat-selection.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/summary/summary.html\napps/cinescope/src/app/summary/summary.scss\napps/cinescope/src/app/summary/summary.ts\napps/cinescope/src/app/toast.ts\napps/cinescope/src/index.html\napps/cinescope/src/main.ts\napps/cinescope/src/styles.scss","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AUJAH3wPUNhjRKJm4ZyKEi","session_id":"da796ddb-14b5-4081-b15a-294e50582b81","uuid":"622bab0c-206a-4667-b936-0255ea871b83","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:37:19.305Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 07 final pass"}
